# dir on every drive: the root, a subdirectory, one file, and a directory
# of two clusters (B:\MANY: 42 entries of 32 bytes, 1 KB clusters), with
# the volume label and the free space mtools gives for each image.
program: shell
keys: dir\nb:\ndir\nc:\ndir docs\nDIR C:\\DOCS\\HELLO.TXT\nd:\ndir \\\ndir b:\\many\n
timeout: 60
emulators: bochs mame
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>dir
 Volume in drive A is RX286
 Directory of A:\
KERNEL   BIN     {image_size}  1989-01-01  00:00
        1 file(s)      {image_size} bytes
                     {image_free} bytes free
